  <section class="service-block" id="sizing">
    <h2 class="h3">Sizing and geometry</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>SENDA Road and Gravel come in five sizes, XS to XL. Geometry tables are on each bike page and are finalised when pre-orders open.</p>
      <table class="table mt-3">
        <thead><tr><th>Rider height</th><th>Indicative size</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody><tr><th>155–163 cm</th><td>XS</td></tr><tr><th>163–172 cm</th><td>S</td></tr><tr><th>172–180 cm</th><td>M</td></tr><tr><th>180–188 cm</th><td>L</td></tr><tr><th>188–198 cm</th><td>XL</td></tr></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block" id="fitting">
    <h2 class="h3">Fitting and test rides</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Every bike reservation includes a fitting at a partner studio in the Zürich area before your bike is built. Test-ride days are announced on the list.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--quiet mt-3" href="#contact">Ask for a fitting date</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block" id="preorder">
    <h2 class="h3">Pre-order and delivery</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Bikes are reserved with a refundable deposit of CHF 300. The balance is paid by bank transfer or QR invoice before delivery. Wheelsets, components and clothing on pre-order are paid at checkout.</p>
      <p>Every pre-order has a delivery window. If it moves, we write before it does. Delivery is free in Switzerland. Proposal: terms to be confirmed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block" id="warranty">
    <h2 class="h3">Warranty and crash replacement</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Frames and ORMA carbon parts carry a warranty on materials and workmanship. If you crash, the first owner can replace a damaged frame or wheel at a reduced price. Proposal: durations and prices to be confirmed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block" id="register">
    <h2 class="h3">Register your SENDA</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Register your frame number to activate the warranty and record ownership in case of theft. The form opens with the first deliveries.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block" id="clothing-sizes">
    <h2 class="h3">Clothing sizes</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Race fit, close to the body. Between two sizes, take the larger one.</p>
      <div class="scroll-x">
        <table class="table mt-3">
          <thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Chest</th><th>Waist</th><th>Height</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><th>XS</th><td colspan="3" class="no">Measurements to come with the production sample</td></tr>
            <tr><th>S to XXL</th><td colspan="3" class="no">Measurements to come with the production sample</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block" id="faq">
    <h2 class="h3">FAQ</h2>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>When will the first bikes be delivered?</summary><p>First deliveries are planned for 2027. Reservations get a delivery window.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is the deposit refundable?</summary><p>Yes, until the frame goes into production for your order.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do ORMA wheels fit my bike?</summary><p>Check the compatibility table on the wheelset page. Disc brakes and 12 mm thru-axles are required.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you deliver outside Switzerland?</summary><p>We start in Switzerland. EU delivery follows once the first series is out.</p></details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block" id="contact">
    <h2 class="h3">Contact</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Write to <a href="mailto:info@sendabikes.com">info@sendabikes.com</a>. We answer within one working day.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

